# Input
```yaml
# should generate diagnostics
true: 1

nested:
  false: 2

flow: { True: 3 }

sequence:
  - FALSE: 4

explicit:
  ? TRUE
  : 5

tagged:
  !!bool "text": 6

anchored: &flag False
aliased:
  ? *flag
  : 7

items:
  - &item
    True: 8

```

